   "summary": "This study measured the taxonomic composition and diversity of Chironomidae (specifically head capsules) collected from 44 surface samples across different habitats, comparing the community composition in Sphagnum hummocks to other habitats. The study measured the relative abundance and frequency of various chironomid taxa across five different peatland habitats (hummock, hollow, ditch, pond, and pool)."
